WEBVTT

1
00:55:47.906 --> 00:55:54.906
It's okay, we will just be friends for these moments, because we are truly livable for a time like this.

2
00:55:54.906 --> 00:55:58.906
Let's take a moment to pray, for we live for moments like these.

3
00:55:58.906 --> 00:56:07.906
I just don't want to play the games of the church. I just want to be livable for Jesus.

4
00:56:07.906 --> 00:56:12.906
Now, in the moment we are in. I want to be livable for Him, now.

5
00:56:12.906 --> 00:56:17.906
I don't want to play church. I really want to be full of life for Jesus at this moment.

6
00:56:30.906 --> 00:56:33.906
And that must be the heartbeat of His people.

7
00:56:33.906 --> 00:56:39.906
We don't want to stay in a little box, but we want to live fully for Him at this moment.

8
00:56:42.906 --> 00:56:58.906
And that can feel uncomfortable, because we are so used to the way things are.

9
00:56:58.906 --> 00:57:03.906
But the Lord wants us right now, just for this time, He wants to wake us up.

10
00:57:13.906 --> 00:57:20.906
And when we wake up to His presence, we will receive more, for He wants to give His life.

11
00:57:31.906 --> 00:57:40.906
So maybe you feel confronted, maybe you feel uncomfortable, maybe you feel that you are being called out of your comfort zone.

12
00:57:40.906 --> 00:57:43.906
But that is what God wants for us at this moment.

13
00:57:51.906 --> 00:57:57.906
There is a surrender happening in the body of Christ, a complete surrender to His way.

14
00:58:11.906 --> 00:58:15.906
And He says, comfort comfort my people.

15
00:58:29.906 --> 00:58:31.906
Let Him speak to your heart.

16
00:58:32.906 --> 00:58:34.906
Let Him speak to your heart.

17
00:58:34.906 --> 00:58:36.906
Rest, rest for my people, says He.

18
00:58:42.906 --> 00:58:44.906
So I pray for us this morning.

19
00:58:44.906 --> 00:58:47.906
Jesus, You are the good Shepherd over Your flock.

20
00:58:52.906 --> 00:58:56.906
And You are calling us awake to see who You truly are.

21
00:59:02.906 --> 00:59:06.906
He sings over us, You sing over us, that is in Zephaniah 3.

22
00:59:11.906 --> 00:59:14.906
He sings over His bride, He sings over His people.

23
00:59:14.906 --> 00:59:16.906
So Lord, pour out over Your people this morning.

24
00:59:16.906 --> 00:59:19.906
All those who are watching now and those who will watch later.

25
00:59:19.906 --> 00:59:26.906
Pour out over them with the fresh taste of Your anointing and Your presence, Holy Spirit.

26
00:59:33.906 --> 00:59:35.906
Give us eyes to see.

27
00:59:37.906 --> 00:59:39.906
Give us hunger, I pray.

28
00:59:41.906 --> 00:59:42.906
Amen, amen.

29
00:59:42.906 --> 00:59:45.906
Well, we will continue with giving and we will continue with worship.

30
00:59:45.906 --> 00:59:48.906
Worship is bringing something back to the Lord.

31
00:59:48.906 --> 00:59:51.906
So whether that is in song or with your gifts.

32
01:00:01.906 --> 01:00:06.906
So we give Him our heart in song, we give Him our cry, we give Him our praise, we give Him a song.

33
01:00:06.906 --> 01:00:09.906
And then we also sow into the kingdom of God with finances.

34
01:00:12.906 --> 01:00:15.906
Our cry, our prayer, our songs.

35
01:00:15.906 --> 01:00:19.906
And we also sow into the kingdom with our finances.

36
01:00:34.906 --> 01:00:36.906
And it is truly a time to sow.

37
01:00:36.906 --> 01:00:38.906
I mentioned that a few weeks ago as well.

38
01:00:38.906 --> 01:00:46.906
It is a time to sow with prayer, to sow with worship, to sow with your finances in the kingdom of God.

39
01:00:58.906 --> 01:01:04.906
And when we sow with our finances in the house of God, there is a great blessing upon our lives.

40
01:01:08.906 --> 01:01:11.906
And now, if you are here, you hear us talking about it.

41
01:01:11.906 --> 01:01:13.906
And you can hear it over and over.

42
01:01:13.906 --> 01:01:17.906
But it must come to the inside so that you want to give.

43
01:01:25.906 --> 01:01:27.906
No one is going to take care of you to give.

44
01:01:27.906 --> 01:01:33.906
But we believe that God calls His people to be generous and to give financially.

45
01:01:39.906 --> 01:01:43.906
So if we can get the ways to give on the screen this morning.

46
01:01:48.906 --> 01:01:50.906
I will thank you that you are loved.

47
01:01:50.906 --> 01:01:52.906
But ultimately Jesus holds you accountable.

48
01:01:52.906 --> 01:01:58.906
Jesus is the only one who is loved by His people, as we are loved by Him.

49
01:01:58.906 --> 01:02:00.906
So you are blessed this morning.

50
01:02:09.906 --> 01:02:11.906
Trust Him.

51
01:02:13.906 --> 01:02:15.906
Trust Jesus with your finances.

52
01:02:19.906 --> 01:02:21.906
Lord, I bless your people this morning.

53
01:02:25.906 --> 01:02:28.906
For we live for just such a time as this.

54
01:02:28.906 --> 01:02:41.906
Thank you for the opportunity and thank you for the calling to rise up and shine in the time that is dark.

55
01:02:45.906 --> 01:02:47.906
Give us strength, give us courage.

56
01:02:51.906 --> 01:02:53.906
I pray that we will remain faithful.

57
01:02:55.906 --> 01:02:57.906
In Jesus' mighty name.

58
01:02:58.906 --> 01:03:05.906
Let the name of the Lord go out as a banner over your household this morning.

59
01:03:06.906 --> 01:03:07.906
Amen.

60
01:03:29.906 --> 01:03:32.906
I am very happy about it. I know that Laura is very happy about it.

61
01:03:32.906 --> 01:03:35.906
I know that the whole band is very happy about it. I know that Vanessa is very happy about it.

62
01:03:35.906 --> 01:03:39.906
I hope that... Yes, that is our new band member.

63
01:03:43.906 --> 01:03:45.906
We love the Lord, Nord.

64
01:03:45.906 --> 01:03:47.906
Christian jokes.

65
01:03:47.906 --> 01:03:51.906
But beautiful. I hope you enjoy it at home as well.

66
01:03:51.906 --> 01:03:58.906
And above all, you know, every note you make to glorify Him, that's what it's all about.

67
01:03:58.906 --> 01:04:01.906
Whether you sing for Him, or whether you clap for Him.

68
01:04:01.906 --> 01:04:05.906
Even if you can't sing, you can still sing for Him.

69
01:04:05.906 --> 01:04:11.906
But it's so nice that we can come together as a band and create something beautiful for Him. Amen.

70
01:04:11.906 --> 01:04:14.906
So we just give this to the Lord.

71
01:04:14.906 --> 01:04:17.906
Do you agree with me? In Jesus' name.

72
01:04:17.906 --> 01:04:18.906
Amen.

73
01:04:18.906 --> 01:04:22.906
And, band, thank you very much.

74
01:04:25.906 --> 01:04:27.906
For every week again.

75
01:04:27.906 --> 01:04:30.906
Every week. Just keep going.

76
01:04:30.906 --> 01:04:33.906
No matter what. Just keep going.

77
01:04:37.906 --> 01:04:41.906
I am very happy with this month that we are now entering.

78
01:04:42.906 --> 01:04:44.906
I am very happy with last week.

79
01:04:44.906 --> 01:04:48.906
Last week was already the first week of November.

80
01:04:49.906 --> 01:04:59.906
And that first week of November could already be a week of the relationships month.

81
01:04:59.906 --> 01:05:06.906
But last week Vanessa and I knew we needed to take some time to pray.

82
01:05:06.906 --> 01:05:11.906
Take time to focus on God. To bless the church of Jesus Christ.

83
01:05:11.906 --> 01:05:15.906
But now we are actually stepping into the relationship month.

84
01:05:15.906 --> 01:05:19.906
Open about relationships. Hallelujah.

85
01:05:20.906 --> 01:05:23.906
Shall we take a moment to pray? I want to pray for this.

86
01:05:23.906 --> 01:05:27.906
Because I want the church of Jesus Christ to be awake.

87
01:05:27.906 --> 01:05:32.906
To learn about relationships. I don’t want us to listen to this while being asleep.

88
01:05:32.906 --> 01:05:37.906
I don’t want us to listen to the advice that comes from the Bible.

89
01:05:37.906 --> 01:05:43.906
And then think, that was nice. And then not do anything with it.

90
01:05:43.906 --> 01:05:47.906
Then you are asleep. But I pray in the name of Jesus.

91
01:05:47.906 --> 01:05:52.906
So if you are at home, would you please close your eyes and pray along with me.

92
01:05:52.906 --> 01:05:55.906
In the name of Jesus, I pray that we will be awake.

93
01:05:55.906 --> 01:05:59.906
That we will see in the spirit what the spirit has to say to his church.

94
01:05:59.906 --> 01:06:07.906
What the Word of God has written and given to us about how we can view relationships.

95
01:06:07.906 --> 01:06:12.906
I pray that we will be holy in the eyes of the Father.

96
01:06:12.906 --> 01:06:17.906
The Father who says, be holy, for I am holy too.

97
01:06:17.906 --> 01:06:21.906
In other words, do as I do.

98
01:06:21.906 --> 01:06:26.906
Be holy, for I am holy, says the Lord.

99
01:06:26.906 --> 01:06:31.906
I tell us as a church that we will be a holy church.

100
01:06:31.906 --> 01:06:37.906
That we will not be an organization of people who come together to do nice things.

101
01:06:37.906 --> 01:06:40.906
But I pray that we will be the kingdom of God.

102
01:06:40.906 --> 01:06:42.906
That we will be holy before Him.

103
01:06:42.906 --> 01:06:47.906
And that we will be holy in the eyes of the Father, so that He can be proud of us.

104
01:06:47.906 --> 01:06:50.906
Jesus, I thank you for your blood.

105
01:06:50.906 --> 01:06:54.906
I want to say now, thank you Jesus for your blood that has cleansed us.

106
01:06:54.906 --> 01:06:57.906
So that we can also live holy lives.

107
01:06:57.906 --> 01:07:01.906
Jesus, I thank you that you have given us your Spirit.

108
01:07:01.906 --> 01:07:04.906
So that we can live holy lives.

109
01:07:04.906 --> 01:07:10.906
Not that we go through life continuously saying that we are victims,

110
01:07:10.906 --> 01:07:16.906
or that we are victims of the sin that always overwhelms us.

111
01:07:16.906 --> 01:07:23.906
We can lead a holy life in the name of Jesus, driven by the Spirit.

112
01:07:24.906 --> 01:07:31.906
This is not arrogance, but this is the Spirit of victory that has been given to us in Christ Jesus our Lord.

113
01:07:31.906 --> 01:07:34.906
May I hear an amen to that, in Jesus' name.

114
01:07:34.906 --> 01:07:36.906
Hallelujah.

115
01:07:36.906 --> 01:07:38.906
Open about relationships.

116
01:07:40.906 --> 01:07:46.906
In this first week, I want to share a few thoughts with you.

117
01:07:46.906 --> 01:07:51.906
I want to share a few sketches of my own life lessons with you.

118
01:07:51.906 --> 01:07:58.906
I also want to advise you to have a pen and paper handy, or your phone or your iPad.

119
01:07:58.906 --> 01:08:02.906
And take notes.

120
01:08:02.906 --> 01:08:06.906
And read those notes from time to time after that week.

121
01:08:06.906 --> 01:08:11.906
For repetition provides a good form of knowledge in your mind.

122
01:08:11.906 --> 01:08:14.906
If you repeat something a few times, you will remember it.

123
01:08:14.906 --> 01:08:18.906
And when you remember it, you will also live with it when you are awake.

124
01:08:19.906 --> 01:08:26.906
And I just want to share a few things from my own life about relationships that have been imprinted on me.

125
01:08:26.906 --> 01:08:30.906
And where I once woke up, and that means repentance.

126
01:08:30.906 --> 01:08:33.906
There are things I have learned in life.

127
01:08:33.906 --> 01:08:39.906
The first two Bible verses I want to share with you are really from my youth, from my childhood.

128
01:08:39.906 --> 01:08:43.906
And I don't know if there are still NBG Christians in the church.

129
01:08:43.906 --> 01:08:46.906
If you are an NBG Christian, say amen.

130
01:08:46.906 --> 01:08:48.906
But there are still those NBG Christians.

131
01:08:48.906 --> 01:08:51.906
And in the first two verses that I want to share with you...

132
01:08:51.906 --> 01:08:56.906
And I would also appreciate it if you could just write down those NBG texts.

133
01:08:56.906 --> 01:08:58.906
They are just short sentences, both of them.

134
01:08:58.906 --> 01:09:01.906
But they are sentences that I want to share with you.

135
01:09:01.906 --> 01:09:05.906
Look, this is a sketch of how Tim's faith is structured.

136
01:09:05.906 --> 01:09:09.906
And I hope this will also become a sketch for your own.

137
01:09:09.906 --> 01:09:14.906
That it will become a life lesson in your life and that you will do something with it.

138
01:09:15.906 --> 01:09:21.906
Here is NBG, Bible verse number 1, Exodus 23, verse 2.

139
01:09:21.906 --> 01:09:28.906
You shall not follow the majority in wrongdoing.

140
01:09:28.906 --> 01:09:32.906
Please do not write you, but just write thou.

141
01:09:32.906 --> 01:09:35.906
For this is NB-divine.

142
01:09:37.906 --> 01:09:42.906
You shall not follow the majority in evil.

143
01:09:42.906 --> 01:09:44.906
These were things.

144
01:09:44.906 --> 01:09:48.906
For all the newcomers in Openkerk...

145
01:09:48.906 --> 01:09:53.906
There was once a time when the previous generation of Reobotkerk...

146
01:09:53.906 --> 01:09:56.906
We had a building in Eersel.

147
01:09:56.906 --> 01:09:58.906
And that building was called de Brink.

148
01:09:58.906 --> 01:10:01.906
And we rented it week in, week out.

149
01:10:01.906 --> 01:10:04.906
Every week setting up, every week taking down.

150
01:10:04.906 --> 01:10:06.906
Every week preparing the chairs.

151
01:10:06.906 --> 01:10:08.906
Every week cleaning everything up again.

152
01:10:08.906 --> 01:10:11.906
Every week working and going on and on.

153
01:10:11.906 --> 01:10:14.906
That was a wonderful pioneering generation.

154
01:10:14.906 --> 01:10:20.906
And because of that pioneering generation, many people now live in Jesus.

155
01:10:20.906 --> 01:10:22.906
That is what it has done.

156
01:10:22.906 --> 01:10:27.906
But there was a sign there, which was put up every week...

157
01:10:27.906 --> 01:10:30.906
So when you have such a hall that you rent...

158
01:10:30.906 --> 01:10:34.906
You prepare the chairs and you set up the stage.

159
01:10:34.906 --> 01:10:36.906
And the drum set is set up every week.

160
01:10:36.906 --> 01:10:40.906
The piano is taken out of the case and set up every week.

161
01:10:40.906 --> 01:10:42.906
The guitars come out every week.

162
01:10:42.906 --> 01:10:44.906
It's hard work.

163
01:10:44.906 --> 01:10:48.906
And to refresh it and brighten it up and to make it thematic...

164
01:10:48.906 --> 01:10:52.906
That such a building, which is normally not used for the church...

165
01:10:52.906 --> 01:10:56.906
To give it a bit of a theme for what you are doing at that moment...

166
01:10:56.906 --> 01:10:59.906
There were sometimes those boards put up.

167
01:10:59.906 --> 01:11:01.906
They had a sort of, I don't know...

168
01:11:01.906 --> 01:11:04.906
Felt-like boards, wood-felt-like boards.

169
01:11:04.906 --> 01:11:08.906
And they had a Christian slogan on them with a visual.

170
01:11:09.906 --> 01:11:10.906
And those...

171
01:11:10.906 --> 01:11:13.906
You shall not follow the majority in evil.

172
01:11:13.906 --> 01:11:15.906
That was a board that was always there.

173
01:11:15.906 --> 01:11:20.906
And as long as I can remember from my Christian life...

174
01:11:20.906 --> 01:11:21.906
I looked at that board.

175
01:11:21.906 --> 01:11:25.906
And it was a red board with a number of black figures on it.

176
01:11:25.906 --> 01:11:27.906
That were all going in one particular direction.

177
01:11:27.906 --> 01:11:30.906
And one white figure that was going the other way.

178
01:11:30.906 --> 01:11:33.906
Very politically incorrect at this moment.

179
01:11:33.906 --> 01:11:36.906
But it was a board where the majority...

180
01:11:36.906 --> 01:11:37.906
That was...

181
01:11:37.906 --> 01:11:41.906
If you do not live in Christ, then you are going the wrong way.

182
01:11:41.906 --> 01:11:43.906
And everyone was going a certain way.

183
01:11:43.906 --> 01:11:45.906
And there were those little guys from the 70s.

184
01:11:45.906 --> 01:11:48.906
I can even see the jeans in that black visual...

185
01:11:48.906 --> 01:11:50.906
Those were those wide pipes.

186
01:11:50.906 --> 01:11:52.906
And they were all going that way.

187
01:11:52.906 --> 01:11:54.906
And there was only one.

188
01:11:54.906 --> 01:11:55.906
We will talk about it shortly...

189
01:11:55.906 --> 01:11:57.906
Rachel is already showing it.

190
01:11:57.906 --> 01:12:00.906
I will show it on the livestream shortly.

191
01:12:00.906 --> 01:12:01.906
That's nice.

192
01:12:01.906 --> 01:12:03.906
Maybe we can arrange this.

193
01:12:03.906 --> 01:12:05.906
You can just throw it in, Stefan, if you see it.

194
01:12:05.906 --> 01:12:06.906
I don't care.

195
01:12:06.906 --> 01:12:07.906
It's just nice, this.

196
01:12:07.906 --> 01:12:09.906
But here is the point.

197
01:12:09.906 --> 01:12:14.906
And there is one who is going against the direction of all the others.

198
01:12:14.906 --> 01:12:22.906
And this is a visual that has been with me since I have known God.

199
01:12:22.906 --> 01:12:29.906
As long as I have lived and have memories of my life in Christ Jesus...

200
01:12:29.906 --> 01:12:36.906
I have memories of the fact that there is a Bible verse that calls me, a child of God...

201
01:12:36.906 --> 01:12:40.906
not to go along with everyone who is going that way.

202
01:12:40.906 --> 01:12:44.906
But I need to go along with everything that God has for me.

203
01:12:44.906 --> 01:12:46.906
And He has a different plan for me.

204
01:12:46.906 --> 01:12:48.906
He has a different purpose for me.

205
01:12:48.906 --> 01:12:52.906
He has a different law for me than all other people...

206
01:12:52.906 --> 01:12:57.906
