207
01:12:58.906 --> 01:13:00.906
And when I think about it, and here is the visual.

208
01:13:00.906 --> 01:13:05.906
You shall not follow the majority in evil.

209
01:13:05.906 --> 01:13:08.906
Do you see those jeans? They are just amazing, right?

210
01:13:08.906 --> 01:13:10.906
70s jeans, almost coming back.

211
01:13:10.906 --> 01:13:12.906
Or it has actually already come back and it has already gone again.

212
01:13:12.906 --> 01:13:14.906
Fashion changes so quickly.

213
01:13:16.906 --> 01:13:18.906
And this is in my mind.

214
01:13:18.906 --> 01:13:23.906
And I hope that this Bible verse will also get into your mind.

215
01:13:23.906 --> 01:13:25.906
Do you know why? I hope that you will be awake to it.

216
01:13:25.906 --> 01:13:27.906
In Jesus' name.

217
01:13:27.906 --> 01:13:29.906
I hope that you will be awake to it.

218
01:13:29.906 --> 01:13:31.906
Here is the other Bible verse.

219
01:13:31.906 --> 01:13:35.906
That was once impressed upon my life and that I have held on to.

220
01:13:35.906 --> 01:13:41.906
Next to you shall not follow the majority in evil.

221
01:13:41.906 --> 01:13:47.906
If you are taking notes today, underline or write in capital letters...

222
01:13:47.906 --> 01:13:49.906
follow up.

223
01:13:50.906 --> 01:13:52.906
For you are a follower.

224
01:13:53.906 --> 01:13:58.906
There are people in society who say I am not a follower.

225
01:13:58.906 --> 01:14:00.906
I do my own thing.

226
01:14:00.906 --> 01:14:02.906
Just like all those other millions of people who say that.

227
01:14:02.906 --> 01:14:04.906
Everyone follows.

228
01:14:04.906 --> 01:14:09.906
Why? Because God has made mirror neurons in your head.

229
01:14:09.906 --> 01:14:12.906
Why? Because God wants you to follow.

230
01:14:12.906 --> 01:14:15.906
God wants you to be a follower.

231
01:14:15.906 --> 01:14:21.906
Why did Jesus talk about the fact that he is the good shepherd and that we are his sheep?

232
01:14:21.906 --> 01:14:27.906
If there is any animal that is a following animal, it is the sheep in the field.

233
01:14:27.906 --> 01:14:30.906
And that is why Jesus says, but I want to be the good shepherd.

234
01:14:30.906 --> 01:14:34.906
Jesus wants you to be a follower.

235
01:14:34.906 --> 01:14:36.906
Bible verse number 1.

236
01:14:36.906 --> 01:14:40.906
You shall not follow the majority in evil.

237
01:14:40.906 --> 01:14:45.906
And this is the Bible verse that I actually want to bring up this whole month.

238
01:14:45.906 --> 01:14:52.906
This politically incorrect visual can now go off the screen and I will move on to Ephesians 4 verse 20.

239
