757
01:47:17.906 --> 01:47:21.906
so then you have to make a joke about it to shock, shock value,

758
01:47:21.906 --> 01:47:23.906
and you have to go further, and further, and further.

759
01:47:23.906 --> 01:47:26.906
And eventually you hear one of the comedians,

760
01:47:26.906 --> 01:47:29.906
