761
01:47:29.906 --> 01:47:30.906
this goes too far.

762
01:47:30.906 --> 01:47:33.906
Why? The circle of mockers.

763
01:47:33.906 --> 01:47:37.906
I will not sit at the table of the circle of mockers.

764
01:47:37.906 --> 01:47:41.906
I prefer to sit by someone at the oven here,

765
01:47:41.906 --> 01:47:44.906
talking about the love of Jesus.

766
01:47:44.906 --> 01:47:47.906
Revelation, upon revelation, upon revelation,

767
01:47:47.906 --> 01:47:50.906
and I gladly light red, delicious.

768
01:47:50.906 --> 01:47:55.906
In the circle of wise people, for when you associate with wise people, you become wise.

769
01:47:55.906 --> 01:47:59.906
But if you are friends with fools, it will go badly for you.

770
01:47:59.906 --> 01:48:00.906
This is what the Bible warns about.

