777
01:48:22.906 --> 01:48:24.906
Your first and best relationship.

778
01:48:24.906 --> 01:48:29.906
And the rest of those relationships should be like dominoes lined up with Jesus.

779
01:48:30.906 --> 01:48:34.906
Proverbs 27 verse 17.

780
01:48:34.906 --> 01:48:38.906
As iron sharpens iron,

781
01:48:38.906 --> 01:48:42.906
as iron sharpens iron,

782
01:48:42.906 --> 01:48:46.906
