794
01:49:27.906 --> 01:49:30.906
And that feels bad, man, for such a boy.

795
01:49:30.906 --> 01:49:33.906
And you see that boy, ah, that's not nice.

796
01:49:33.906 --> 01:49:37.906
But his behavior needs to be sharpened.

797
01:49:37.906 --> 01:49:40.906
And I can still see it so clearly, I've heard it thousands of times,

798
01:49:40.906 --> 01:49:44.906
