800
01:49:47.906 --> 01:49:49.906
No weekend leave, he would say.

801
01:49:49.906 --> 01:49:52.906
Because you did this, this or this.

802
01:49:52.906 --> 01:49:55.906
And then he turned around and said, iron sharpens iron.

803
01:49:55.906 --> 01:49:58.906
And that simply means, iron sharpens iron.

804
01:49:58.906 --> 01:50:01.906
Christians must keep Christians sharp.

805
01:50:01.906 --> 01:50:06.906
I want to interact with people who say to me, Tim, this can be better.

806
01:50:06.906 --> 01:50:09.906
