812
01:50:26.906 --> 01:50:28.906
Not perfect, but heading towards God.

813
01:50:28.906 --> 01:50:30.906
That is what I am looking for.

814
01:50:30.906 --> 01:50:33.906
I am not looking for perfect people, because I already have Jesus.

815
01:50:33.906 --> 01:50:35.906
So I don't need to search anymore.

816
01:50:35.906 --> 01:50:40.906
I am only looking for people who also want to look at that perfect person Jesus.

817
01:50:40.906 --> 01:50:44.906
And those people who have walked a path of experience,

818
01:50:44.906 --> 01:50:47.906
seek wise people, lift up wise people, so that I can also become wise.

819
01:50:47.906 --> 01:50:49.906
I am looking for wisdom.

820
01:50:50.906 --> 01:50:54.906
