837
01:52:10.906 --> 01:52:16.906
And that means, if your pain has been inflicted, for example, through your parental line.

838
01:52:16.906 --> 01:52:22.906
Then it makes sense that you go somewhere with that pain and eventually find something to relate to.

839
01:52:22.906 --> 01:52:27.906
And you enter into a relationship, and guess what, in that relationship you will also hurt the other person.

840
01:52:27.906 --> 01:52:34.906
Because your pain has been inflicted in the previous relationship, related to, you have endured.

